      "event": "Space Colonization Begins",
      "detail": "The first permanent human settlements on the Moon and Mars are established, marking the beginning of humanity's expansion into space."
    },
    {
      "year": 2080,
      "event": "Climate Catastrophes and Mass Migrations",
      "detail": "Severe weather events and rising sea levels cause large-scale displacements of populations, leading to significant geopolitical tensions and the creation of climate refugee crisis centers."
    },
    {
      "year": 2090,
      "event": "Quantum Computing Transforms Society",
