      "event": "Space Economy Booms",
      "detail": "Space-based industries thrive, including asteroid mining, space tourism, and the construction of large-scale space habitats, further driving the expansion of humanity into the solar system."
    },
    {
      "year": 2200,
      "event": "Genetic Engineering and Longevity Advances",
      "detail": "Breakthroughs in genetic engineering and medical technology significantly extend human lifespans, raising ethical questions about population control and resource distribution."
